/*
 * HAWK hot32 sampler tables (32-bit thresholds).
 *
 * Generated by e8/tables/gen_tables.py; do not edit.
 * Regenerate: python3 tables/gen_tables.py --out tables (from e8/), or `make tables`,
 * which fails if the committed tables differ.
 *
 * Per logn: one hot row per parity p of the target (x in 2Z + p,
 * x = 2y + p with y ~ D(-p/2, sigma_sign), sigma_sign = 1.010, 1.278, 1.299);
 * values are x. K = 6 hot values; rules: see gen_tables.py.
 * Requires <stdint.h>.
 */

